   "parts": [
    [
     1,
     "<div style=\"word-wrap:break-word;line-break:after-white-space\"><div style=\"font-family:Helvetica,Arial;font-size:13px;color:rgba(0,0,0,1.0);margin:0px;line-height:auto\">Try: </div><div style=\"font-family:Helvetica,Arial;font-size:13px;color:rgba(0,0,0,1.0);margin:0px;line-height:auto\"><br></div><div style=\"font-family:Helvetica,Arial;font-size:13px;color:rgba(0,0,0,1.0);margin:0px;line-height:auto\">z2 ~~ 0*z2</div><div style=\"font-family:Helvetica,Arial;font-size:13px;color:rgba(0,0,0,1.0);margin:0px;line-height:auto\"><br></div><div style=\"font-family:Helvetica,Arial;font-size:13px;color:rgba(0,0,0,1.0);margin:0px;line-height:auto\">I could be wrong, but I think that’s the way. (you should see it on the output)</div><div style=\"font-family:Helvetica,Arial;font-size:13px;color:rgba(0,0,0,1.0);margin:0px;line-height:auto\">Otherwise someone more experienced could chime in.</div><div style=\"font-family:Helvetica,Arial;font-size:13px;color:rgba(0,0,0,1.0);margin:0px;line-height:auto\"><br></div><div style=\"font-family:Helvetica,Arial;font-size:13px;color:rgba(0,0,0,1.0);margin:0px;line-height:auto\">Best,</div><div style=\"font-family:Helvetica,Arial;font-size:13px;color:rgba(0,0,0,1.0);margin:0px;line-height:auto\">Nick</div></div>"
