    ],
    [
     3,
     "<div style=\"word-wrap:break-word;line-break:after-white-space\"><blockquote type=\"cite\"><span><div><div>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n<div dir=\"ltr\">\r\n<div class=\"gmail_default\" style=\"font-family:georgia,serif\">Hi\r\nlavaan users,</div>\r\n<div class=\"gmail_default\" style=\"font-family:georgia,serif\">\r\n<br></div>\r\n<div class=\"gmail_default\" style=\"font-family:georgia,serif\">Does\r\nanyone know the syntax for fixing the residual variance of an item\r\nin bifactor CFA model to equal 0? I feel like this should be easy\r\nto find, but I&#39;m having trouble finding this info in previous\r\nposts/other places. </div>\r\n<div class=\"gmail_default\" style=\"font-family:georgia,serif\">\r\n<br></div>\r\n<div class=\"gmail_default\" style=\"font-family:georgia,serif\">For\r\nexample, if I wanted to fix the residual variance of item z2 below\r\nto 0--what would the syntax would be? </div>\r\n<div class=\"gmail_default\" style=\"font-family:georgia,serif\">\r\n<br></div>\r\n<div class=\"gmail_default\" style=\"font-family:georgia,serif\">model\r\n&lt;- &#39;g =~x1 + x2 + x3 + x4 + x5 + z1 + z2 + z3 + z4 + z5 +\r\nz6</div>\r\n<div class=\"gmail_default\" style=\"font-family:georgia,serif\">f1 =~\r\nz1 + z2 + z3 + z4 + z5 + z6</div>\r\n<div class=\"gmail_default\" style=\"font-family:georgia,serif\">f2 =~\r\nx1 + x2 + x3 + x4 + x5&#39;<br>\r\n <br>\r\nfit &lt;- lavaan::cfa(model, data = item.set2,  ordered\r\n= </div>\r\n<div class=\"gmail_default\" style=\"font-family:georgia,serif\">\r\nc(&quot;x1&quot;, &quot;x2&quot;, &quot;x3&quot;, &quot;x4&quot;, &quot;x5&quot;, &quot;z1&quot;, &quot;z2&quot;, &quot;z3&quot;, &quot;z4&quot;, &quot;z5&quot;,\r\n&quot;z6&quot;),<br>\r\n<a href=\"http://std.lv\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://std.lv&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792423551458000&amp;usg=AOvVaw3mAh8hhwxPdFMP07wXtI-S\">std.lv</a> = TRUE, missing = &quot;pairwise&quot;,\r\northogonal = TRUE) <br></div>\r\n<div class=\"gmail_default\" style=\"font-family:georgia,serif\">\r\n<br></div>\r\n<div class=\"gmail_default\" style=\"font-family:georgia,serif\">Thank\r\nyou!</div>\r\n</div></div></div></span></blockquote></div>"
