     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><div><blockquote class=\"gmail_quote\" style=\"margin:0;margin-left:0.8ex;border-left:1px #ccc solid;padding-left:1ex\"><div class=\"gmail_quote\"><blockquote class=\"gmail_quote\" style=\"margin:0px 0px 0px 0.8ex;border-left:1px solid rgb(204,204,204);padding-left:1ex\"><div><div style=\"font-family:Helvetica,Arial;font-size:13px;color:rgb(0,0,0);margin:0px\">Try: </div><div style=\"font-family:Helvetica,Arial;font-size:13px;color:rgb(0,0,0);margin:0px\"><br></div><div style=\"font-family:Helvetica,Arial;font-size:13px;color:rgb(0,0,0);margin:0px\">z2 ~~ 0*z2</div><div style=\"font-family:Helvetica,Arial;font-size:13px;color:rgb(0,0,0);margin:0px\"><br></div><div style=\"font-family:Helvetica,Arial;font-size:13px;color:rgb(0,0,0);margin:0px\">I could be wrong, but I think that’s the way. (you should see it on the output)</div><div style=\"font-family:Helvetica,Arial;font-size:13px;color:rgb(0,0,0);margin:0px\">Otherwise someone more experienced could chime in.</div><div style=\"font-family:Helvetica,Arial;font-size:13px;color:rgb(0,0,0);margin:0px\"><br></div><div style=\"font-family:Helvetica,Arial;font-size:13px;color:rgb(0,0,0);margin:0px\">Best,</div><div style=\"font-family:Helvetica,Arial;font-size:13px;color:rgb(0,0,0);margin:0px\">Nick</div> <div><div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"color:rgb(34,34,34);font-family:arial,sans-serif;font-size:small;line-height:normal\"><font size=\"1\" face=\"Arial\" style=\"color:rgb(136,136,136)\"><br></font></div></div> <br><p>On June 11, 2019 at 11:47:52 PM, Keri J. S. Brady (<a rel=\"nofollow\">keri.j...@gmail.com</a>) wrote:</p> </div></blockquote></div></blockquote></div></div>"
    ],
    [
     2,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><div><blockquote class=\"gmail_quote\" style=\"margin:0;margin-left:0.8ex;border-left:1px #ccc solid;padding-left:1ex\"><div class=\"gmail_quote\"><blockquote class=\"gmail_quote\" style=\"margin:0px 0px 0px 0.8ex;border-left:1px solid rgb(204,204,204);padding-left:1ex\"><div><blockquote type=\"cite\"><span><div><div>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n<div dir=\"ltr\">\r\n<div style=\"font-family:georgia,serif\">Hi\r\nlavaan users,</div>\r\n<div style=\"font-family:georgia,serif\">\r\n<br></div>\r\n<div style=\"font-family:georgia,serif\">Does\r\nanyone know the syntax for fixing the residual variance of an item\r\nin bifactor CFA model to equal 0? I feel like this should be easy\r\nto find, but I&#39;m having trouble finding this info in previous\r\nposts/other places. </div>\r\n<div style=\"font-family:georgia,serif\">\r\n<br></div>\r\n<div style=\"font-family:georgia,serif\">For\r\nexample, if I wanted to fix the residual variance of item z2 below\r\nto 0--what would the syntax would be? </div>\r\n<div style=\"font-family:georgia,serif\">\r\n<br></div>\r\n<div style=\"font-family:georgia,serif\">model\r\n&lt;- &#39;g =~x1 + x2 + x3 + x4 + x5 + z1 + z2 + z3 + z4 + z5 +\r\nz6</div>\r\n<div style=\"font-family:georgia,serif\">f1 =~\r\nz1 + z2 + z3 + z4 + z5 + z6</div>\r\n<div style=\"font-family:georgia,serif\">f2 =~\r\nx1 + x2 + x3 + x4 + x5&#39;<br>\r\n <br>\r\nfit &lt;- lavaan::cfa(model, data = item.set2,  ordered\r\n= </div>\r\n<div style=\"font-family:georgia,serif\">\r\nc(&quot;x1&quot;, &quot;x2&quot;, &quot;x3&quot;, &quot;x4&quot;, &quot;x5&quot;, &quot;z1&quot;, &quot;z2&quot;, &quot;z3&quot;, &quot;z4&quot;, &quot;z5&quot;,\r\n&quot;z6&quot;),<br>\r\n<a href=\"http://std.lv\" rel=\"nofollow\" target=\"_blank\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://std.lv&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792423551462000&amp;usg=AOvVaw3tAhnACpcgjD-ESamCZJvj\">std.lv</a> = TRUE, missing = &quot;pairwise&quot;,\r\northogonal = TRUE) <br></div>\r\n<div style=\"font-family:georgia,serif\">\r\n<br></div>\r\n<div style=\"font-family:georgia,serif\">Thank\r\nyou!</div>\r\n</div>\r\n--<br>\r\nYou received this message because you are subscribed to the Google\r\nGroups &quot;lavaan&quot; group.<br></div></div></span></blockquote></div></blockquote></div></blockquote></div></div>"
    ],
